;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;5.9k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;405&lt;br&gt;Ethr is a Comprehensive Network Measurement Tool for TCP, UDP &amp;amp; ICMP.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2&gt;👋 Hi!&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mikeroyal&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/github/followers/mikeroyal?logo=GitHub&amp;amp;style=for-the-badge&quot; alt=&quot;GitHub followers&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mikeroyal&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/github/stars/mikeroyal?logo=github&amp;amp;style=for-the-badge&quot; alt=&quot;GitHub Stars&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/mikeroyal?color=9147FF&amp;amp;logo=twitch&amp;amp;style=for-the-badge&quot; alt=&quot;Twitch Status&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I&#39;m Michael Royal, a senior software engineer, content creator, and a Self-Hosting/HomeLab enthusiast. I also create and contribute to many open source projects. I really enjoy building open source software, creating and contributing to communities, teaching others through blog/video content, and helping others via chat/forums.&lt;/p&gt; 
